  ],
  "og_image": "/assets/og/the-distance-power-creates.png",
  "og_image_alt": "Why Leaders Lose Touch as They Rise: The higher you rise, the easier it becomes for people to know your name while fewer people actually know you. TheWrkShop, Leadership & Culture.",
  "scriptures": [
    {
      "ref": "Deuteronomy 17:18-20",
      "text": "He is to read it all the days of his life so that he may learn to revere the LORD his God…. and not consider himself better than his fellow Israelites…."
    },
    {
      "ref": "Romans 12:3",
      "text": "Do not think of yourself more highly than you ought…."
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "the_revelation",
      "label": "The Revelation",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Power creates distance."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Sometimes intentionally.",
            "Sometimes structurally.",
            "Sometimes without anyone noticing."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "More leadership.",
            "More responsibility.",
            "More access.",
            "More recognition.",
            "More people needing something from you."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "And slowly relationships change."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "People prepare before talking to you.",
            "They choose their words more carefully.",
            "They laugh harder at your jokes.",
            "They hesitate before disagreeing.",
            "They tell you what went well.",
            "They solve problems before you see them."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Eventually:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "YOU MAY EXPERIENCE A DIFFERENT ORGANIZATION THAN EVERYONE ELSE."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Not because anyone held a meeting and decided to deceive you."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Power changed the environment."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_lie",
      "label": "The Lie",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "“PEOPLE TREAT ME THIS WAY BECAUSE THIS IS WHO I AM.”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Maybe."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Or:"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "because you’re the boss.",
            "the pastor.",
            "the owner.",
            "the donor.",
            "the executive.",
            "the successful person.",
            "the person controlling opportunity."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Power makes interpretation difficult."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Is that agreement?",
            "Or fear?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Respect?",
            "Or dependence?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Honor?",
            "Or access-seeking?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Loyalty?",
            "Or self-protection?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "POWER CAN MAKE APPLAUSE DIFFICULT TO INTERPRET."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "why_god_warned_kings",
      "label": "Why God Warned Kings",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Deuteronomy 17 gave Israel’s future kings unusual instructions."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The king was to remain under God’s Word."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Why?"
        },
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "“…and not consider himself better than his fellow Israelites….”"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Think about that."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "The man everybody bows to must repeatedly remember:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "YOU ARE STILL A MAN UNDER GOD."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Position changed.",
            "Humanity didn’t."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Authority increased.",
            "Dependence didn’t disappear."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Power creates elevation.",
            "Scripture creates remembrance."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "distance_changes_information",
      "label": "Distance Changes Information",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "The frontline knows something executives don’t.",
            "Children know something parents don’t.",
            "Employees know something owners don’t.",
            "Congregants know something pastors don’t."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Why?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Different proximity."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "And if everyone near power filters reality,",
            "distance grows."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Eventually:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "THE LEADER’S VIEW FROM THE TOP CAN BECOME HIS BLIND SPOT."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "He sees farther.",
            "But not necessarily closer."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_truth",
      "label": "The Truth",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Healthy leaders intentionally shorten unnecessary distance."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Not by pretending authority doesn’t exist.",
            "It does."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "But by building pathways for truth."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Questions.",
            "Feedback.",
            "Accountability.",
            "Unfiltered conversations.",
            "Proximity to ordinary people.",
            "Relationships with people who don’t need anything from them."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "And especially:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "PEOPLE WHO KNEW YOU BEFORE THE TITLE AND ARE UNIMPRESSED BY IT."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Those relationships can be gifts."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_audit",
      "label": "The Audit",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "bullet_list",
          "items": [
            "WHO SPEAKS TO ME DIFFERENTLY BECAUSE OF MY POSITION?",
            "WHO HAS NOTHING TO GAIN FROM IMPRESSING ME?",
            "WHO CAN INTERRUPT ME?",
            "WHO SEES ME OUTSIDE MY ROLE?",
            "DO I KNOW WHAT LIFE FEELS LIKE THREE LEVELS BELOW ME?",
            "HAS MY POSITION CREATED DISTANCE I NO LONGER NOTICE?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Then:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "WHO KNOWS THE MAN BEHIND THE AUTHORITY?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_surrender",
      "label": "The Surrender",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Don’t surrender authority.",
            "Surrender superiority."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Remember:"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "POSITION IS ASSIGNMENT. NOT IDENTITY."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Come back under Scripture.",
            "Come back under accountability.",
            "Come back near people."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "And remember:"
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "You may lead the room.",
            "But you remain:"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "A MAN UNDER GOD."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "take_it_with_you",
      "label": "Take It With You",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "quote",
          "text": "Power creates elevation. Scripture creates remembrance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "the_prayer",
      "label": "The Prayer",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Father,"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Keep authority from distorting how I see myself."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "Keep me close to Your Word.",
            "Close to truth.",
            "Close to people.",
            "Close to accountability."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Surround me with people who love me enough not to be impressed by my title."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Never let position convince me I have outgrown dependence."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "I remain a man under God."
        },
        {
          "type": "lines",
          "items": [
            "In Jesus name,",
            "Amen."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "hidden_gems",
      "label": "Hidden Gems 💎",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "👉",
          "text": "You may experience a different organization than everyone else."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Power can make applause difficult to interpret."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "The leader’s view from the top can become his blind spot."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Power creates elevation. Scripture creates remembrance."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "Position is assignment, not identity."
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "prefix": "💎",
          "text": "You may lead the room, but you remain a man under God."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "-TheWrkShop"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "__insert_block_header": "2026-10-26_deuteronomy-17-18-20_the-distance-power-creates|"
}
